            <description><![CDATA[<h3>VoiceInk 2.21-ads.1</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Restore media playback and system mute correctly after rapid recordings and output-device changes.</li>
  <li>Fix case-only dictionary replacements and merge replacement variants with the same target.</li>
  <li>Duplicate modes from their context menu without copying automatic triggers.</li>
  <li>Improve audio playback and consistency between History and Quick History.</li>
  <li>Configure Finish and Send globally instead of per mode.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
